r transparency and does not execute any code or make changes.', 'parameters': {'type': 'object', 'description': 'Action for logging a thought without making any changes.', 'properties': {'thought': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'The thought to log.'}}, 'required': ['thought']}}]}], 'thinkingConfig': {'thinkingLevel': 'minimal'}}



