                             </group>\n    90\t  )\n    91\t}\n    92\t```\n    93\t\n    94\t### B. Auto-Layout (Grid & Flex)\n    95\t\n    96\tUse these props on the                  
                             `<group>` tag to arrange children automatically without manual X/Y math.\n    97\t\n    98\t  * **Schematic Layout:** `schFlex`,                             
